==Battleground==
*1 [[Great Angel Chibinel]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Chibinel combined with the infinite Sinner Snaches can wipe out fodder units with concerning ease, though aren't too difficult to manage. If one is worried about this, a slightly more powerful melee fodder unit or [[Li'l Dark Cat|talented Li'l Dark Cat]] should be able to deal with this stage with ease.

